  "kind": "recipe",
  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "standard",
    "description": "tonyd2wild's original DeepSeek-V4-Flash (pre-0731 release) profile on two Sparks: vLLM tensor parallel 2 without Ray, FP8 KV cache, DeepSeek MTP with two drafted tokens, b12x MoE kernels and a 1,000,000-token context on aidendle94's published vLLM fork image (digest-pinned, used unmodified). Upstream's 500K rollback profile is a memory option plus the context and concurrency settings (500000 and 8). Same-creator alternatives for this Spark count with the 0731 checkpoint are the DSpark recipes. Licences (information only): recipe MIT, model MIT. Upstream figures (about 45.5 tok/s single stream at MTP 2, 2.84M-token KV pool at 1M context) are claims until measured here; Vonk physical two-Spark acceptance is pending. The first request after boot can time out while autotune and warmup finish.",
    "tags": [
      "deepseek",
      "distributed",
      "fp8-kv",
      "mtp",
      "reasoning",
      "spark",
      "tool-use",
      "vllm"
    ],
    "title": "DeepSeek V4 Flash MTP vLLM two Sparks (tonyd2wild)"
